{"duration_api_ms":11062,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f7de66d9-bb49-4693-9f46-e75e30d5b77c","total_cost_usd":0.03626,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1719,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1125,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":209},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1719,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1125,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1719,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1719},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":1125,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1719,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.03626,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":209,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":1719,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"# B2に入れる数式（Excel・スプレッドシート共通）\n\nMicrosoft 365のExcelとGoogleスプレッドシートのどちらも`XLOOKUP`に対応しているため、**同じ数式が使えます**。\n\n取引先マスタが「取引先マスタ」という名前の別シートにある場合は、次のとおりです。\n\n```\n=XLOOKUP(A2, 取引先マスタ!$D$2:$D$11, 取引先マスタ!$A$2:$A$11, \"未登録\")\n```\n\n同じシートにある場合は、シート名を外します。\n\n```\n=XLOOKUP(A2, $D$2:$D$11, $A$2:$A$11, \"未登録\")\n```\n\n※シート名が違う場合は、「取引先マスタ」の部分を実際のシート名に変えてください。\n\n---\n\n## 数式の読み方\n\n| 部分 | 意味 |\n|---|---|\n| `A2` | このメールアドレスを探す |\n| `$D$2:$D$11` | マスタのD列（メール）の中から探す |\n| `$A$2:$A$11` | 見つかった行のA列（取引先コード）を表示する |\n| `\"未登録\"` | 見つからなければ「未登録」と表示する |\n\nつまり「**A2のメールをD列から探して、同じ行のA列を返す。なければ『未登録』**」という意味です。\n\n- `XLOOKUP`は、探す列（D列）が表示したい列（A列）より右にあっても使えます。`VLOOKUP`では、この並びのままでは取り出せません。\n- `$`を付けて範囲を固定しているため、B2をB3以下にコピーしても範囲がずれません。\n\n---\n\n## 補足\n\n**メールの前後に余分な空白が入っていると、「未登録」になります。** 受信メールからコピーした値で起こりやすいです。気になる場合は、空白を取り除く`TRIM`を加えた次の数式を使ってください（どちらのソフトでも使えます）。\n\n```\n=XLOOKUP(TRIM(A2), 取引先マスタ!$D$2:$D$11, 取引先マスタ!$A$2:$A$11, \"未登録\")\n```\n\nなお、大文字と小文字は区別されないため、`Test-Foods@example.com`でも見つかります。\n\n**古いバージョンのExcelでも使いたい場合**は、次の数式にしてください。\n\n```\n=IFERROR(INDEX(取引先マスタ!$A$2:$A$11, MATCH(A2, 取引先マスタ!$D$2:$D$11, 0)), \"未登録\")\n```\n\nこの数式は`XLOOKUP`が使えないExcel 2019以前でも動き、スプレッドシートでも使えます。","ttft_ms":3246,"type":"result","duration_ms":14203,"uuid":"fa4d6345-144f-4110-aecf-a1870e4c8c24","ttft_stream_ms":1525,"time_to_request_ms":84,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":9,"system_prompt":1,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":8,"input_hooks":5,"conversation_append":1,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":7,"autocompact":1,"request_announcements":8,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":2,"message_normalization":9,"client_creation":4,"request_build":11},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":34,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":86,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":203,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":127,"process_rss_mib_result":200,"process_anon_mib_result":118,"process_peak_rss_mib":215,"process_cpu_ms_turn":532,"process_wall_ms_turn":14202,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":272,"process_wall_ms_streaming":9607,"main_stream_count":1,"main_stream_event_count":168,"main_stream_chunk_count":162,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":272,"wall_ms":96